1. Screen OnVisible

This is why the title shows blank and the meta line is just | — varCalRegion was never set.

Set(varCalRegion, LookUp(Choices('Meeting Notes'.Region), Value = "EMEA"));
Set(varShowModal, false);
Select(lblLoadData)
2. Put Visible back to varShowModal

You hardcoded true on some controls — that's why the modal appears on every screen entry. Check recScrim, recModalCard, txtRecap and any other you edited. Each one:

Visible: varShowModal
3. Make date clicks open it

Components → cmpCalendar → lblCellHit → OnSelect. Replace entirely:

Set(varCalSelected, ThisItem.CellDate);
If(
    !ThisItem.InMonth,
    Set(varCalMonth, Date(Year(ThisItem.CellDate), Month(ThisItem.CellDate), 1))
);
Set(varCurrentMeeting, LookUp(colMeetings, DateValue(Text('Meeting Date', "yyyy-mm-dd")) = ThisItem.CellDate));
ClearCollect(
    colEditActions,
    ForAll(
        Filter('Meeting Action Items', Meeting = varCurrentMeeting) As A,
        {
            TempID: GUID(),
            ActionRec: A,
            Descr: A.'Action Description',
            Assignee: A.'Assigned To',
            Stat: A.Status.Value,
            Removed: false
        }
    )
);
Set(varShowModal, true)

After 1–3, clicking a date opens the modal and it stays shut otherwise.

